WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:06,290
Just listen to me and follow me

2
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:10,960
Although I'm not much older than you

3
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,560
But I can barely be considered an elder.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,880
Anyway, you are right to listen to me.

5
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:19,700
Okay, you take the lead

6
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:44,740
Weird, the phone has signal

7
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,380
Why can't I get through on the phone?

8
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,940
Maybe it makes sense that there is no signal in the village

9
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,220
Then I'll send a message

10
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:51,900
There's no telling when there's a signal

11
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:53,220
they can see

12
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,710
I don’t know what’s going on at home.

13
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:58,700
In the dream, my hometown was divided into

14
00:00:58,700 --> 00:00:59,700
S-level security area

15
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:01,660
It should be safe at home
